1
00:01:04,519 --> 00:01:05,079
Gentlemen, gentlemen.

2
00:01:05,799 --> 00:01:06,480
Buy a newspaper!

3
00:01:07,680 --> 00:01:08,640
Breaking news!

4
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:10,879
Big news from Lijia Town last night!

5
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:11,599
Mengzhu is dead.

6
00:01:12,719 --> 00:01:13,640
Mengzhu is dead.

7
00:01:14,879 --> 00:01:16,799
Benefactor Li's bloodline might end here.

8
00:01:17,359 --> 00:01:18,040
How did she die?

9
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:19,359
I know about this.

10
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:20,680
At the Li Mansion...

11
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:22,480
The living occupy it by day,

12
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:23,799
and ghosts take over by night.

13
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:27,159
Master Li had three wives in succession.

14
00:01:27,680 --> 00:01:28,560
They all died mysteriously.

15
00:01:29,319 --> 00:01:30,040
Later on, I heard

16
00:01:30,159 --> 00:01:32,519
their wronged spirits haunt Li Mansion.

17
00:01:32,799 --> 00:01:34,079
They appear as soon as night falls.

18
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:34,799
Run!

19
00:01:35,079 --> 00:01:36,239
The First Wife is back!

20
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:47,519
Then how exactly

21
00:01:48,079 --> 00:01:49,239
did they die?

22
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:51,560
The First Wife died suddenly.

23
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:52,840
Madam!

24
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:53,519
Somebody, help!

25
00:01:55,879 --> 00:01:56,359
The Second Wife

26
00:01:56,760 --> 00:01:57,680
was killed by a falling chandelier.

27
00:02:00,079 --> 00:02:01,400
The Second Wife is dead!

28
00:02:04,959 --> 00:02:06,760
The Third Wife fell suddenly ill

29
00:02:07,519 --> 00:02:09,159
and died as if possessed.

30
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,080
Hurry, save her!

31
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,879
And now, his daughter is dead,

32
00:02:13,039 --> 00:02:13,520
Mengzhu.

33
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,639
All four of them

34
00:02:16,639 --> 00:02:18,000
were claimed by a vengeful spirit.

35
00:02:21,439 --> 00:02:22,159
Who is Jiang Huai?

36
00:02:24,479 --> 00:02:24,919
I am.

37
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:26,960
So you're Jiang Huai.

38
00:02:27,479 --> 00:02:29,639
Jiang Huai is exactly who our lady wants.

39
00:02:29,840 --> 00:02:30,199
Grab him!

40
00:02:30,199 --> 00:02:31,080
Your lady?

41
00:02:31,439 --> 00:02:32,719
Kidnapping someone in broad daylight?

42
00:02:32,879 --> 00:02:33,280
What are you doing?

43
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:34,000
Get out of the way!

44
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:35,680
Stop it!

45
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:36,759
Let my master go!

46
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:37,800
Let me go!

47
00:02:37,919 --> 00:02:38,719
Let go! Scram!

48
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:40,400
Why are you hitting people?

49
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:42,919
Our lady is having a ghost marriage.

50
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:44,240
You're the one our lady fancies.

51
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:44,759
Come with us!

52
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:45,479
Move! It's time for a ghost marriage.

53
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:46,120
Hurry up!

54
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,000
Let my master go!

55
00:02:47,039 --> 00:02:47,759
I don't even know you guys!

56
00:02:47,759 --> 00:02:48,360
- Master! - Move!

57
00:02:48,919 --> 00:02:49,960
Wh-what are you doing?

58
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:50,560
Enough.

59
00:02:51,159 --> 00:02:52,319
Is there no law here?

60
00:02:52,599 --> 00:02:53,560
The law?

61
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:54,879
Half of this Lijia Town

62
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:56,400
was funded and built by Benefactor Li.

63
00:02:56,919 --> 00:02:57,400
Around here,

64
00:02:57,719 --> 00:02:58,800
Benefactor Li is the law.

65
00:03:00,039 --> 00:03:00,759
Ghost marriage?

66
00:03:01,039 --> 00:03:01,719
How does that work?

67
00:03:02,199 --> 00:03:02,919
How does that work?

68
00:03:03,039 --> 00:03:04,759
Finding a spouse for the deceased.

69
00:03:04,919 --> 00:03:05,479
Simply put,

70
00:03:05,639 --> 00:03:06,560
they'll take the couple

71
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:08,439
and bury them together in one coffin.

72
00:03:09,319 --> 00:03:09,800
As for you,

73
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:11,800
during the holidays from now on,

74
00:03:12,039 --> 00:03:13,240
burn extra paper money for your master.

75
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:16,159
Master!

76
00:03:16,199 --> 00:03:16,639
You...

77
00:03:18,319 --> 00:03:18,960
Detective!

78
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,520
Something happened to my master!

79
00:03:20,599 --> 00:03:21,639
You have to save him!

80
00:03:22,879 --> 00:03:24,680
Isn't your master incredibly capable?

81
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:27,520
He made the gold shop robbery into a story

82
00:03:27,719 --> 00:03:28,800
and made you tell it.

83
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:29,680
Now look,

84
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:30,919
the whole town knows about the case.

85
00:03:32,199 --> 00:03:33,120
Please, Detective!

86
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:34,800
You have to save my master!

87
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:36,800
Benefactor Li took him for a ghost marriage.

88
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:38,800
He'll be buried with a dead person!

89
00:03:38,879 --> 00:03:39,560
Wait, wait.

90
00:03:40,759 --> 00:03:42,840
What... what ghost marriage?

91
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:45,360
If you just save my master,

92
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:47,360
I'll work like a horse to repay you!

93
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,439
- Please, Detective! - Alright, alright!

94
00:03:48,439 --> 00:03:49,360
- I promise you. - Please save my master!

95
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:50,039
I promise you.

96
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:51,199
I'll save your master.

97
00:03:52,039 --> 00:03:52,560
Where is he?

98
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:55,759
Just you?

99
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:57,560
They're skilled fighters.

100
00:03:58,039 --> 00:03:59,400
Shouldn't you get some backup?

101
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:00,000
No need.

102
00:04:00,919 --> 00:04:01,560
I'm more than enough.

103
00:04:02,319 --> 00:04:03,240
Back in school,

104
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:04,400
I was the kickboxing champion.

105
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:05,919
That's enough.

106
00:04:06,439 --> 00:04:06,840
Let's go.

107
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:08,400
It's just like Master said.

108
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:09,360
She's not well-liked.

109
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:11,120
She doesn't even have a single officer.

110
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:15,800
My lady...

111
00:04:16,519 --> 00:04:18,319
Why did you have to leave so soon?

112
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:22,040
Chunmei didn't even get to see you marry.

113
00:04:22,639 --> 00:04:24,040
When you reach the underworld,

114
00:04:24,199 --> 00:04:25,759
don't cross the Bridge of Helplessness yet.

115
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:28,279
Wait for your groom, Jiang Huai.

116
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:28,839
Move!

117
00:04:29,639 --> 00:04:31,519
Your grand wedding is tonight.

118
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:34,120
Behave yourself!

119
00:04:35,879 --> 00:04:36,439
My lady,

120
00:04:36,959 --> 00:04:39,759
Didn't you love Jiang Huai's storytelling?

121
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:42,160
He'll be there to keep you company soon.

122
00:04:44,879 --> 00:04:45,399
Move!

123
00:04:45,519 --> 00:04:46,120
Keep moving!

124
00:04:54,079 --> 00:04:55,160
What are you looking at? Move it!

125
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,560
Move! Move!

126
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:02,360
My lady!

127
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:06,959
Stop yelling! Hurry up!

128
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:20,680
What are you looking at?

129
00:05:20,759 --> 00:05:21,759
Keep moving! Move it!

130
00:05:27,879 --> 00:05:28,279
Move!

131
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:29,600
Hurry up!

132
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,199
Guard the door.

133
00:05:31,399 --> 00:05:31,800
Don't let anyone in.

134
00:05:31,959 --> 00:05:32,399
Got it.

135
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:33,160
Get back to work.

136
00:05:33,160 --> 00:05:34,240
Move. We can't miss the auspicious hour.

137
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:44,279
Hurry up!

138
00:05:45,399 --> 00:05:46,199
Behave!

139
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:51,959
Kneel!

140
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:07,319
Mengzhu of the Li Mansion died young.

141
00:06:08,399 --> 00:06:11,920
In life, she admired scholar Jiang Huai.

142
00:06:13,079 --> 00:06:16,720
To fulfill Mengzhu's dying wish,

143
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:19,720
May Mengzhu, on the road to the underworld,

144
00:06:19,839 --> 00:06:21,120
have a husband by her side,

145
00:06:21,279 --> 00:06:22,319
and no longer be lonely.

146
00:06:24,199 --> 00:06:24,680
Here.

147
00:06:28,959 --> 00:06:31,240
Bury this with Mengzhu in her coffin.

148
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:32,360
Heavenly Craftsmanship.

149
00:06:33,199 --> 00:06:34,399
How did it end up in his hands?

150
00:06:34,879 --> 00:06:37,680
The Wenchang Pavilion in our family library

151
00:06:38,079 --> 00:06:40,439
holds over 13,000 ancient books.

152
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:42,920
Especially this one.

153
00:06:43,639 --> 00:06:44,560
The sole surviving Ming Dynasty copy,

154
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:46,079
Heavenly Craftsmanship.

155
00:06:47,759 --> 00:06:49,959
It records over 300 crafting methods,

156
00:06:50,839 --> 00:06:52,879
and is a priceless treasure of Chinese crafting.

157
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:55,560
You must protect this book well.

158
00:06:56,360 --> 00:06:57,639
When the situation stabilizes,

159
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:58,879
print more copies of it.

160
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:00,199
Popularize these crafting methods

161
00:07:01,079 --> 00:07:03,800
so our ancestors' wisdom endures forever.

162
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:04,600
Yes, Father.

163
00:07:06,839 --> 00:07:08,079
The lifeblood of our Jiang family

164
00:07:08,439 --> 00:07:10,040
is this book, Heavenly Craftsmanship.

165
00:07:10,879 --> 00:07:11,360
Remember.

166
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:13,399
As long as you live,

167
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:15,439
the book must survive.

168
00:07:16,879 --> 00:07:17,839
Huai, run!

169
00:07:18,519 --> 00:07:19,319
Run!

170
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:31,920
Could they have come back again?

171
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:32,800
Master, don't be afraid.

172
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:34,600
As long as Eldest Miss is buried in time,

173
00:07:34,959 --> 00:07:36,160
this disaster will be quelled.

174
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:38,680
Eldest Miss must be buried tonight.

175
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:42,879
Heaven and Earth witness the soul's return.

176
00:07:43,319 --> 00:07:46,079
Yin and Yang in harmony, forever at peace.

177
00:07:46,879 --> 00:07:49,360
The ghost marriage wine seals this union.

178
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:53,079
Li Mengzhu and Jiang Huai are now wed.

179
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:56,560
Escort them to the mourning hall!

180
00:07:58,639 --> 00:07:59,480
A ghost!

181
00:07:59,519 --> 00:08:00,920
A ghost! Run!

182
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:02,480
They've come back!

183
00:08:05,199 --> 00:08:06,000
A ghost!

184
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:48,600
Husband
